# Wave T56 (Palmside kit): pearlroof — PEARL STUCCO SLABS: smooth pearl-white stucco in the town style's own family (roof #e8d9c4/#bfae94/#f7ecdc), a soft cream shadow course under each slab's lip and a faint shell-pink blush at the joints — the painting's white villa roofs, flat and calm. NO shingle courses, NO lattice, NO boards: structurally unlike Wildreach's adoberoof (khaki clay slabs, wide dark joints), Fenland's boardroof (vertical timber boards), Brightshore's panelroof (rigid panels). Worn by both villa stamps + both facade cottages. (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T56-PALMSIDE-PLAN.md §5.)
